dsh-preset-force is a community plugin for DeepSeek Assistant.

This package is a maintained fork of @wasd258/dsh-preset-force (0.1.2) by
WASD258-jpg, published under the MIT License. The original package stops at
0.1.2 and cannot be installed as a DSH bundle; this fork adds the missing
bundle registration and fixes several defects. Diff notes: FORK-NOTES.md.

The implementation references the dsh-agent-presets recompose seam and the
session event log (agent-presets/session subsystems) of DeepSeek Assistant:

  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-assistant

